0  years so we're trying to create  templates that we could then you know  use in other places in the city  JPMorgan is halfway through its  five-year commitment to the city of  Detroit but a city is more than its  buildings when I say the city's our  partner they're our full partner  they're bringing tools to the game  they're bringing the sentence to the  game they're bringing disincentives to  the game all of those things are gonna  help us accelerate you know the  redevelopment of these neighborhoods  [Music]

